DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppmmaapp__zzeerroo__ppaaggee() function zero-fills an entire page using machine-de‐
     pendent optimizations.  The ppmmaapp__zzeerroo__ppaaggee__aarreeaa() function is used to
     zero-fill an area of a page.  The range specified must not cross a page
     boundary; it must be contained entirely within a single page.

